<title>USA: Dow Chemical sets environmental venture.</title>
<headline>Dow Chemical sets environmental venture.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Mich. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dow Chemical Co said Friday it formed a joint venture with a Washington D.C.-based environmental consulting firm to manage the chemical firm's environmental clean-up projects.</p>
<p>Dow said it will own 85 percent of the joint venture, named Raven Group Ltd. The rest will be owned by EOP Group Inc, the consulting company.</p>
<p>Dow said Raven will help identify cost-effective clean-up solutions at Dow's U.S. manufacturing facilities.</p>
